  "review": "\n<!-- 個別詳細レビューコンテナ -->\n<div class=\"space-y-8\">\n  <!-- ファーストビュー・作品ヘッダー -->\n  <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-900 to-rose-950/30 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-2xl flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-start\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3 flex-shrink-0\">\n      <div class=\"relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-slate-700/80 group\">\n        <img src=\"https://pics.dmm.co.jp/digital/video/meyd00920/meyd00920pl.jpg\" alt=\"無垢な生徒を食べつくすかなえ先生の誘惑搾精授業 夢実かなえ\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500\" loading=\"eager\" />\n        <div class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 bg-rose-600/90 text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-lg backdrop-blur-sm\">\n          特集第5位\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-rose-400 tracking-wider uppercase mb-1.5 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n          <span>🏆</span> 【放課後の密室・美人女教師の特別個人指導】FANZA「二人きりの準備室で理性が崩...\n        </div>\n        <h1 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-black text-white leading-snug\">無垢な生徒を食べつくすかなえ先生の誘惑搾精授業 夢実かなえ</h1>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300\">\n        <p><strong class=\"text-slate-400\">出演キャスト：</strong> <a href=\"/actress/yume-mi-kanae\" class=\"text-rose-400 hover:text-rose-300 underline font-bold transition\">夢実かなえ</a></p>\n        <p><strong class=\"text-slate-400\">メーカー：</strong> <span class=\"text-slate-200\">TAMEIKE</span></p>\n        <p><strong class=\"text-slate-400\">品番・CID：</strong> <span class=\"font-mono text-amber-300 font-bold\">meyd00920</span></p>\n        <p><strong class=\"text-slate-400\">抜擢理由：</strong> <span class=\"text-rose-300 font-medium\">無垢な生徒を翻弄する妖艶な指導 / 夢実かなえが魅せる甘美な搾精授業</span></p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- キラーポイント箇条書き -->\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-800/60 rounded-2